        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Hiramu imfumu ya ku Turi yatumine inkombe kuli Davidi, pamo ne fimuti ifyalepesha ifya keda na bakusona mabwe elyo na bakabasa wa mbao abakwisa kuula isano lyakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Davidi aishiba nokuti Yawe namwimika ukuba imfumu ya bena Israeli, kabili nokutila ubufumu bwakwe nabusumbulwa nganshi pa mulandu wa bantu baiko abena Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu Yerusalemu Davidi aupile abakashi na bambi. Akwata na bambi abana abaume na banakashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya e mashina ya bana bakwe abafyelwe kuli ena mu Yerusalemu: Shamua, Shobabu, Natani, Solomoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ibihali, Elishua, Elipeleti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noga, Nefegi, Yafiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elishama, Beeliyada elyo na Elifeleti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo Abafilisiti baumfwile ukuti Davidi nasubwa ukuba imfumu ya bena Israeli, baimine bonse mu maka ukuya balefwaya Davidi. Lelo Davidi alyumfwile pali ifi, nao aima kukuya bakumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nomba Abafilisiti balishile no kusansa ishika lya Refaimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi aipusha Lesa ati, “Bushe kuti nanina no kuya sansa Abafilisiti? Bushe kuti wabapeela mu minwe yandi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yawe amwasuka ati, “Kabiye, ndi nokubapeela mu minwe yobe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi na bantu bakwe epakwima baya ku Bali Perasimu, na Davidi eko aya bacimfisha. Elyo Davidi asosa nokuti, “Ngefyo amenshi yapongoloka, Lesa napongolokela pa balwani bandi ukupitila mu kuboko kwandi.” Kanshi epakwita ilya ncende ati Baali Perasimu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Baali Perasimu calola mukuti, “Imfumu yapongoloka nga menshi.”.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abafilisiti baposele imilungu yabo kulya kwine, na Davidi apeele icipope cakuti bayoce mu mulilo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili Abafilisiti babwekeshepo ukusansa aba mu mukonko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo Davidi epakwipusha Lesa, kabili na Lesa amwasuka ati, “Wibalungama pakunina pamulu, lelo ubashinguluke elyo ubasanse ku ntanshi ya fimuti fya basamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14:14",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "basamu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lishina lya fimuti fya “Balsam.” Cena, cimuti uko balefumya icapala icinyamuti icanunka ubusaka icakupangilako amafuta aya cena icisuma ne miti.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyofye uleumfwa iciunda ca nshindo pa mulu wa fimuti fya basamu, elyo uli nokuya mukulwa, pantu Lesa naima mukukutangilila, mukusansa ifita fya nkondo ifya Bafilisiti.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi Davidi epakucita ifyo Lesa amukonkomeshe, kabili aipeye ifita fya nkondo ifya Bafilisiti, inshila yonse ukufuma ku Gibeoni ukufika ku Gesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ululumbi lwakwa Davidi epakusalangana mpanga yonse, na Yawe alenga imishobo yonse ukulamutiina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.14.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
